  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1238998,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 007 - Liebesgrüsse aus Moskau (James Bond 007: From Russia with Love) - Nintendo GameCube\n\nStep into the iconic shoes of James Bond in *007 - Liebesgrüsse aus Moskau*, a thrilling action-adventure game based on Ian Fleming’s classic novel and the beloved 1963 film. Experience the espionage and intrigue of the Cold War as Bond investigates a plot to assassinate a defecting Soviet scientist, Tatiana Romanova.\n\nThe game expands upon the film's narrative, adding new action sequences and altering the villain's affiliations for a fresh, dynamic experience. Relive the glamour of the Bond era with familiar gadgets and vehicles, including the iconic Aston Martin DB5 and the jet pack from *Thunderball*. \n\nFor the first time ever, experience Sean Connery’s likeness and voice acting, bringing the legendary spy to life in stunning detail on the GameCube. Engage in intense gunfights, thrilling car chases, and cunning puzzle-solving as you navigate exotic locations and uncover a deadly conspiracy. *007 - Liebesgrüsse aus Moskau* delivers a classic Bond adventure with a modern gaming twist."
    },
